ressbook><name>NAKANISHI, TOSHIAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIRATORI, KAZUHIDE</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIDA MASANOBU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIKUCHI HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONOSHITA YUKIE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANISHI TOSHIAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIRATORI KAZUHIDE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIDA, MASANOBU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIKUCHI, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONOSHITA, YUKIE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANISHI, TOSHIAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIRATORI, KAZUHIDE</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A thermal transfer printer system (100) comprises a thermal transfer ink sheet cassette (10) and a thermal transfer printer (50) in which the thermal transfer ink sheet cassette (10) is loaded. An IC label (20) having an IC memory (21) in which specific identification information is recorded and from which the specific identification information is electrically read, a power receiving coil (23) and diode (24) both connected to the IC memory (21), a communication coil (22) for intercommunication of signals between the IC memory (21) and the thermal transfer printer is attached to the thermal transfer ink sheet cassette (10). The thermal transfer printer (50) supplies driving power from a power supply unit (55) through a power supply coil (61), the power receiving coil (23) and the diode (24) to the IC memory (21). A system controller (51) reads identification information and use history information from the IC memory (21) through the communication coil (22) and a communication coil (56) so as to control the printing operation.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un système d'impression (100) à transfert thermique comprenant une cassette de feuille d'encre (10) à transfert thermique et une imprimante à transfert thermique (50) dans laquelle est chargée la cassette (10). Un dispositif étiquette CI (20), attaché à la cassette (10), est constitué d'une mémoire CI (21) dans laquelle une information d'identification spécifique est enregistrée et à partir de laquelle ladite information est lue électriquement, d'un enroulement de réception d'énergie (23) et d'une diode (24) tous deux reliés à la mémoire CI (21), d'un enroulement de communication (22) permettant l'intercommunication de signaux entre la mémoire CI (21) et l'imprimante à transfert thermique. L'imprimante à transfert thermique (50) fournit, à partir d'une unité d'alimentation (55), l'énergie de fonctionnement à la mémoire CI (21) par l'intermédiaire d'un enroulement d'alimentation (61), de l'enroulement de réception d'énergie (23) et de la diode (24). Un dispositif de commande du système (51) lit l'information d'identification et utilise un historique stocké dans la mémoire CI (21) via les enroulements de communication (22,56) de manière à commander l'opération d'impression.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>